 },
 {
  "line": "coming. But what",
  "image": "002.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "exactly is it?",
  "image": "003.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "And what does it mean for ordinary",
  "image": "004.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "people like you and me?",
  "image": "005.png"
 },
 {
  "line": "To understand it,",
